{"link":{"rel":"self","url":"https://www.sciencebase.gov/catalog/item/696a75d5d4be0228872d3bf8"},"relatedItems":{"link":{"url":"https://www.sciencebase.gov/catalog/itemLinks?itemId=696a75d5d4be0228872d3bf8","rel":"related"}},"id":"696a75d5d4be0228872d3bf8","identifiers":[{"type":"DOI","scheme":"https://www.sciencebase.gov/vocab/category/item/identifier","key":"doi:10.5066/P1WKQ63T"},{"type":"USGS_keywords","scheme":"https://www.sciencebase.gov/vocab/category/item/identifier","key":"Mineral Resources"}],"title":"Mineral Commodity Summaries 2026 Data Release","summary":"This database contains the United States salient statistics and world production statistics for over 90 nonfuel mineral commodities. Salient statistics for the United States includes items such as production, imports, exports, price, stocks, apparent consumption, and/or net import reliance for nonfuel mineral commodities. The database contains separate table files (entities) in CSV format. There are metadata files associated with these CSV files that describe the data.","body":"This database contains the United States salient statistics and world production statistics for over 90 nonfuel mineral commodities. Salient statistics for the United States includes items such as production, imports, exports, price, stocks, apparent consumption, and/or net import reliance for nonfuel mineral commodities. The database contains separate table files (entities) in CSV format. There are metadata files associated with these CSV files that describe the data.","citation":"National Minerals Information Center, 2026, U.S. Geological Survey Mineral Commodity Summaries 2026 Data Release: U.S. Geological Survey data release, https://doi.org/10.5066/P1WKQ63T.","purpose":"Published on an annual basis, the USGS Mineral Commodity Summaries report is the earliest Government publication to furnish estimates covering nonfuel mineral industry data. Data sheets contain information on the domestic industry structure, Government progr